Wɔmaŋ lɛ hu yɛ be kome mli

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:22.430
Yɛ maŋ ko ni shikpɔŋ lɛ da nɔ lɛ, esoro sinifeemɔ he fɛɛ sinifeemɔ be.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.100
No sɛɛ lɛ, Sini He Gbɛjianɔtoo lɛ

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:28.900
Eji nɔ ni anyɛɛɛ ajo naa foi akɛ shihilɛ mli nibii tamɔ be ni akɛtsuɔ nii lɛ baaná enɔ hewalɛ.

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:32.760
Nibii nɛɛ ejeee kpo oya ja obi domain he nilelɔ lɛ tɛ̃ɛ.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:33.950
Eyɛ mlɛo akɛ oookpa

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.610
Domain he nilelɔi sumɔɔ ni amɛku amɛhiɛ amɛshwie nɛkɛ saji nɛɛ anɔ.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:40.010
Ejaakɛ ekolɛ abaajie mlitsɔɔmɔ lɛ kɛjɛ mli

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:43.640
Akɛni awie wekukpaa ni yɔɔ dependency lɛ he lɛ mli faŋŋ hewɔ lɛ

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:47.500
Agbɛnɛ ha wɔkɛ wɔjwɛŋmɔ ama Sini He Gbɛjianɔtoo lɛ mli nibii anɔ.

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:52.230
Klɛŋklɛŋ lɛ, mɛni ji nɔ ni mɔ ni heɔ nii lɛ feɔ yɛ Sini He Gbɛjianɔtoo lɛ mli?

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:54.230
Ha wɔbi domain he nilelɔi lɛ

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.880
Mɛni mɛi ni baahe nii lɛ feɔ?

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:59.970
Nihɔɔlɔi taoɔ sinii,

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.450
Kwɛmɔ sini mli fitsofitso,

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:02.910
Halamɔ be ni abaajie sini lɛ,

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.450
Halamɔ osɛi,

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:05.920
Wolo sini tikitii,

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.610
Kwɛmɔ he ni ato lɛ mli fitsofitso,

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.180
Feemɔ nibii tamɔ he ni okɛto lɛ ni ooofo mli

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:15.750
Ani be ni akɛbaajie sini lɛ kpo lɛ halamɔ kɛ sɛi ni ahalaa lɛ fata sini tikiti he gbɛjianɔtoo lɛ he?

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.880
Ni koni akɛ sini tikitii ato, ni ajie nɔ ni akɛto lɛ

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:22.210
Fɛɛ sɛɛ lɛ, ani jeee akɛ oheɔ tikiti kɛkɛ ni onine shɛɔ shika nɔ?

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.620
oja

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.030
Nakai eji

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:27.880
Ejaakɛ eji domain ni ale jogbaŋŋ bianɛ

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:31.240
Halamɔ be ni okɛbaajie sini lɛ kpo lɛ ni ohala he ni obaata

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.200
Ani enɛ fata sini tikiti he gbɛjianɔtoo lɛ he?

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:34.530
Ma nyɛ ma bi

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:37.220
Shi kɛji eji he ko ni aleee,

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.160
Nibii ni akɛtsuɔ nii lɛ eko fɛɛ eko mlipɛimɔ fitsofitso

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:43.330
Obaatĩ tsɔne ni akɛjieɔ tsɔne lɛ mli lɛ mli shii abɔ.

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:45.350
Edamɔ nitsumɔ lɛ shihilɛ lɛ nɔ

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:48.080
Obaanyɛ okɛ gbɛ nɛɛ atsu nii shii abɔ,

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.580
Babaoo ni okɛ obei pɛiɔ mli jogbaŋŋ lɛ, .

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:54.190
Tsɔɔmɔ kaa kɛ tɔmɔ nɔ yɛ gbɛjianɔtoo kɛ nitsumɔ mli.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.530
Edamɔ sanegbaa ni tee nɔ kɛbashi bianɛ lɛ nɔ

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.970
Wɔto wɔ nihɔɔlɔi ahe saji ahe gbɛjianɔ yɛ henɔi ejwɛ mli:

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.470
Nɔ ni nyiɛ sɛɛ ji nɔkwɛlɔ lɛ

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:08.850
Nɔkwɛlɔ lɛ baanyɛ ana akɛ nɔkwɛmɔ nibii enumɔ yɛ:

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:13.620
Mi diɛŋtsɛ mikwɛɔ mihe nɔ jogbaŋŋ yɛ wiemɔ "Manage" ni akɛtsuɔ nii yɛ hiɛyaa mli lɛ he.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.980
Manage ji wiemɔ ni mli kwɔ tsɔ

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:19.030
Ebɛ faŋŋ akɛ nɔ ni ofeɔ

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:20.950
Nakai eji yɛ biɛ hu

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.760
Te akwɛɔ nɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ ahaa tɛŋŋ?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.810
Hileee

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.620
Kɛtsɔ domain he nilelɔi ni ooowie lɛ nɔ

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.220
Atsake nɔkwɛmɔ nibii lɛ eko fɛɛ eko mli kɛtee nitsumɔ pɔtɛɛ ko mli.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.660
Kɛji akɛ eji nitsumɔ diɛŋtsɛ

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.890
Ekolɛ nibii ni akɛtsuɔ nii babaoo yɛ fe enɛ.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.000
Biɛ mifee lɛ mlɛo kɛha shishitsɔɔmɔ.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.700
Nɔ ni he hiaa ni esa akɛ okadi yɛ biɛ ji akɛ, kɛ́ ofee foidamɔ be lɛ, .

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.900
Obaanyɛ ona akɛ afee tikiti lɛ hu

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.200
Ni kɛ́ oohe tikiti loo okɛ shika lɛ ku sɛɛ aha lɛ

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:53.910
Obaanyɛ ona hu akɛ wɔkɛ kponɔgbɛ nitsumɔ ko ni atsɛɔ lɛ nyɔmɔwoo shinaa lɛ tsuɔ nii.

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:58.670
Mikɛ nibii ni mɛi ni heɔ nii lɛ kɛ nitsumɔ nɔkwɛlɔi lɛ kɛtsuɔ nii lɛ fata he.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:01.730
Kɛji akɛ okwɛ bɔ ni akɛtsuɔ nii ahaa lɛ fɛɛ tamɔ nɛkɛ

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.900
Nɔ ko nuɔ he akɛ nɔ ko bɛ mli

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.840
Gbɛ ko yɛ ni atsɔɔ nɔ akɛ sinifeemɔ he ko fataa he

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:08.720
Mikwɛɛɛ nɔ ko tamɔ Taomɔ Sinifeemɔ He

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.130
Etamɔ nɔ ni nibii ni akɛtsuɔ nii fioo komɛi yɛ ni ajieɔ kɛjɛɔ mli.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.980
Ejaakɛ kɛjɛ domain he nilelɔ ko susumɔ naa lɛ, nibii babaoo yɛ ni esa akɛ atsɔɔ mli.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.950
Nɛkɛ nitsumɔ nɛɛ, ni tamɔ nɔ ni yɔɔ faŋŋ,

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.810
Obaanyɛ ojie mlitsɔɔmɔ lɛ kɛjɛ mli

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.460
No hewɔ lɛ, kɛjɛ mɔ ni feɔ nibii lɛ hu?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:28.290
Ehi jogbaŋŋ akɛ ooojie adafitswaa saji ni yɔɔ mlɛo tamɔ sinifeemɔ he taomɔ kɛjɛ mli.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.700
Ani enɛ eyeee ebuaaa babaoo kɛha woji akwɛmɔ?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:32.870
Kɛji akɛ eji sɛɛgbɛ tsɔne

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.920
Nibii ni akɛtsuɔ nii ni yɔɔ mlɛo tamɔ sinifeemɔ he taomɔ

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.760
Misusuɔ akɛ ehi akɛ oootsi ohe kɛjɛ he

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:41.570
Nɔ ni mikɛɔ ji akɛ, etsɛko tsɔ ni abaaha hetoo yɛ nitsumɔ lɛ mli.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.310
Shi kɛji akɛ eji nitsumɔ diɛŋtsɛ

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:48.450
Kɛha mɛi ni toɔ skrin he gbɛjianɔ lɛ, nɛkɛ nibii ni akɛtsuɔ nii nɛɛ ji shishijee kpakpa.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.300
Mɔ ni toɔ gbɛjianɔ lɛ kwɛ bɔ ni akɛ sinifeemɔ he taomɔ tsuɔ nii ahaa lɛ mli.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:55.300
Te esa akɛ mafee tɛŋŋ koni enyɛ etao sinii afeemɔ hei?

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.600
O ma nyɛ ma susu níhi a he

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.880
Kɛ́ okɛ mfonirii lɛ fata he lɛ, etamɔ nɔ ni eyɛ mlɛo.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.150
Kɛ́ eji nitsumɔ diɛŋtsɛ kulɛ, ebaafee nɔ ni wa kwraa fe nakai.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.240
Yɛ shihilɛ nɛɛ mli lɛ, ehe ehiaaa ni anyɛ mɔ nɔ ni ekɛ ehe awo mli.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:13.910
Mikɛ amɛ ebɔ he yɛ biɛ kɛkɛ koni majie lɛ kpo akɛ saji komɛi yɛ ni elaaje.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.490
Mikɛ woji ni elaaje lɛ fɛɛ wo mli

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.880
Miyɛ nɔ ko ni akɛtsuɔ nii ni ajieɔ tsakpaa ni yɔɔ shwɛlɔ lɛ teŋ lɛ.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:25.720
Enɛ kɔɔ mɛi ni heɔ nii lɛ kɛ nitsumɔ nɔkwɛlɔi lɛ fɛɛ ahe.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.480
Ni bɔni afee ni etsumɔ afee mlɛo lɛ, miŋma yɛ Blɔfo mli.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.160
Ehi bianɛ ejaakɛ nitsumɔ bibioo ko ni

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.160
Kɛji nitsumɔ lɛ da ni eyɛ mlɛo

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.980
Nɛgbɛ esa akɛ domain he nilelɔ aje mlitsɔɔmɔ shishi yɛ?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.380
Eko&nbsp;ɔ, e&nbsp;he maa wa

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.300
Mɛni nɔkwɛlɔ ko tsuɔ?

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.700
Eji nitsumɔ babaoo

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.620
Taakɛ akpaa gbɛ kɛjɛɔ nitsumɔ nɔkwɛlɔ lɛ dɛŋ lɛ

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.750
Yɛ sane nɛɛ mli lɛ, ani wɔbaanyɛ wɔjara mɛi ni feɔ sini lɛ amli?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.340
Eji jwɛŋmɔ kpakpa hu akɛ oookwɛ mli

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.790
Shishijee lɛ, atsɛɔ mi akɛ nɔkwɛlɔ

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.400
Ekolɛ abaanyɛ aja mli yɛ gbɛfaŋnɔ naa

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.820
Ni akɛ Sini He Gbɛjianɔtoo lɛ tsuɔ nii

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.870
Ekolɛ nitsumɔi ni jɛɔ kponɔgbɛ baa yɛ

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.340
Kɛji wɔjara shwɛlɔi lɛ amli tamɔ nɛkɛ,

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.420
Domain he nilelɔi baanyɛ amɛkɛ saji ni ato he gbɛjianɔ babaoo aha.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.000
Eji anɔkwale akɛ, enɛ ji nɔkwɛmɔnɔ kome pɛ ni tsɔɔ bɔ ni akwɛɔ nɔ ko ni mli wa mli.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.320
Ekolɛ gbɛi kpakpai krokomɛi hu yɛ

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.740
Ehe miihia ni aha hetoo yɛ gbɛ ni yɔɔ mlɛo nɔ yɛ shihilɛ lɛ naa.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.060
Enɛ ji naagbee wiemɔ lɛ

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.170
Be nɛɛ mli lɛ, wɔkɛ nɔ ni akɛtsuɔ nii lɛ he mfoniri baatsu nii

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.840
Okɛ otii amamɔ ohiɛ kɛha nitsumɔ lɛ

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.700
Mitsɔ shishijee fãi ni akɛpɛiɔ nii amli lɛ amli.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:38.010
Mi diɛŋtsɛ, yɛ shweremɔ nifeemɔ lɛ fɛɛ mli

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.060
Misusuɔ akɛ mlipɛimɔ ji nɔ ni wa fe fɛɛ

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.250
Ejaakɛ esa akɛ wɔto susumɔi ni bɛ faŋŋ ni bɛ faŋŋ fe fɛɛ lɛ ahe gbɛjianɔ.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.650
Be kroko lɛ wɔbaakwɛ nibii titri ni akɛtsuɔ nii lɛ amli

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.470
Ha wɔpɛi mli fitsofitso

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.100
Oyiwaladɔŋŋ yɛ nitsumɔ ni otsu kɛbashi bianɛ lɛ hewɔ.

